# The peak: a snow-dusted rocky summit left of center. Its skyline is snow
# from end to end, so at night (snow goes to slate) the crest still stands
# off the navy sky; its rock never meets the sky bare (spec 5.6, 8). The lit
# face, turned left, holds the snowfield; the face turned right is in
# shadow, glacier blue; rock ribs and gullies below.
